            "title": "AI Strategy & Vision",
            "image": "",
            "alt": "AI strategy and vision",
            "hook": "Unsure where AI fits into your business? We'll chart the course.",
            "problem": "Many businesses recognize AI's potential but lack a clear roadmap to integrate it effectively, leading to fragmented efforts and missed opportunities.",
            "resolution": "Atlas AI Consulting provides comprehensive strategic planning, identifying high-impact AI use cases tailored to your business goals and competitive landscape, ensuring a clear path to innovation.",
