            "title": "AI Implementation & Development",
            "image": "",
            "alt": "AI implementation and development",
            "hook": "From concept to code, we build robust AI solutions that deliver.",
            "problem": "Developing and deploying AI models can be complex, requiring specialized technical expertise and careful integration into existing systems, often overwhelming internal teams.",
            "resolution": "Our expert engineers handle the full lifecycle of AI development, from model design and training to deployment and maintenance, ensuring seamless integration and optimal performance.",
            "tags": [
              "Development",
              "Integration",
              "Deployment"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "feature-training",
          "type": "article-card",
